WEBVTT

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:15.820
Morning.

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:21.420
I'm awake.

00:02:23.430 --> 00:02:24.590
What's next?

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:28.490
Morning, Yuzuyu-chan!

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:30.660
Nice weather again today, eh?

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:31.920
Onee-sama.

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:35.130
Kippei's making lunch, eh?

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:36.030
What's this?

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:39.240
Two lunches?

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:53.070
What?

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.180
You're making one for yourself too today?

00:02:57.700 --> 00:02:58.530
Lunches.

00:02:58.790 --> 00:02:59.510
No.

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:01.560
For me?

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:03.890
I really don't need one.

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:06.780
I said no.

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:08.730
Who's it for then?

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:12.930
For my girlfriend.

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:21.000
What?!

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:23.810
What interesting thing are you doing?

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:26.420
You've never done this before!

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:27.640
Are you serious?

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:28.980
Is it your youth?

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:32.470
No, I've been away from school for a while because of my cold...

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:35.020
And since I haven't seen her...

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:37.770
Tell us more!

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:39.510
What kind of girls is she?

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:40.530
Is she cute?

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:43.430
Cut it out.

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:45.720
There's no way we'll do that!

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:47.600
Now you've got us all fired up!

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:49.710
It's not the time for that now.

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:52.530
What the heck!? Tell us!

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:54.140
That's right!

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:57.650
I'm happy you got a girlfriend!

00:03:57.850 --> 00:03:59.590
Jeez. Go away!

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:00.410
Like hell I'll go!

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:02.970
You should bring her here next time!

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:04.830
Yes yes! I want to see her, too!

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:07.570
Sis, you'll just get upset if I bring a girl over here.

00:04:07.570 --> 00:04:09.440
If you do it right, I won't get angry.

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:10.680
Sis!

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:13.790
Yuzuyu-chan, I'll see you later.

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:17.030
See ya!

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:20.470
Jeez! Treating me like an old hag!

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:22.910
Sis!

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:35.370
Here!

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:39.650
What?

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:41.790
I've made a lunch.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:44.160
For you... Here!

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:47.610
As an apology for...recently!

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:53.070
The fact that I ignored you for a month... and for everyone wondering how you can stand me...

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:54.640
Err... not that.

00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:57.510
Anyway, I did my best to make it!

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:01.800
I'm so embarrassed!

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:03.210
Doing this sort of thing...

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:19.190
Kokoro-chin... umm... say something.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.730
Do you have a lunch of your own?

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:23.600
No...

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:26.880
I eat the bread I buy from the old lady.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:28.310
I always do.

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:32.570
I'll give you my lunch.

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:35.320
Are you happy?

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:38.290
Yes.

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:42.250
If so, I'll make you one every day!

00:05:42.760 --> 00:05:46.060
Because you're really important to me.

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:48.730
A lunch?

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:50.840
Well, I guess that's love.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:55.370
Don't you think there are other ways of expressing it?

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:57.190
That's right!

00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:59.160
Like going on a date or something once in a while.

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:03.180
You have Yuzuyu, so...

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.080
The bell's chiming...

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:14.310
Next is gym.

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:15.400
I've gotta change.

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:22.580
Hey! Kokoro!

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:23.760
Keep it together!

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:25.330
Are you paying attention to me!?

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:30.810
Jeez! Your aura's way too happy!

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:33.320
It's somehow... cute.

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:45.040
Tadah!

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:50.540
Tadah?

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:53.920
Moron!

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:57.500
My socks are new!

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:59.330
NEW!

00:06:59.520 --> 00:06:59.950
Huh?

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:02.580
Look!

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:07.970
How cute!

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:22.580
Marika-chan! Your new socks got dirty!

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:30.590
Sorry!

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.730
The ball flew away!

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:34.570
Namiko-chan.

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:36.110
Sorry!

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:40.620
Thanks for stopping the ball.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:43.810
Are you okay?

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:47.020
If you wash it, it'll go away for sure.

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:05.810
Huh?

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:07.120
Where's Kokoro-chin?

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:08.960
She's busy with committee work.

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:10.410
I see.

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:13.090
I thought we'd eat early.

00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:15.640
Lunch break is after next period.

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:18.110
Then I'll have to endure it!

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:20.180
You're one happy man.

00:08:20.970 --> 00:08:27.280
There are times when I want to do something for Kokoro-chin, no matter what!

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:32.800
I wonder if it's because we usually can't be together...

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:34.720
I see.

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:38.240
Sensei! Let's eat!

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:40.600
Everyone! Let's eat!

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:44.590
Mr. Bunny!

00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:46.890
Look!

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:49.910
Hey! Look!

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:54.510
Mr. Bear!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:57.750
How nice!

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.750
Your lunch is amazing, Yuzuyu-chan!

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:01.800
Sensei!

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:05.520
Kippei-onii-chan made it for me!

00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:07.840
Oh, my! How cute!

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:12.820
Kippei-onii-chan must really love you!

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:17.000
Yep!

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:24.790
Let's eat!

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:30.620
What's this?

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:32.900
It's a turtle...

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:35.440
A turtle?

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:41.480
Ah, it really is... a turtle.

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:42.950
Yep!

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:45.940
Yuzuyu-chan gets a bear, so... Kokoro-chin gets a turtle!

00:09:47.590 --> 00:09:48.830
Where's that Kokoro?

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:54.220
Kokoro... you don't like turtles?

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:57.420
No...I'm happy.

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:06.950
Your lunch is really elaborate!

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:09.170
Are you free in the morning?

00:10:09.610 --> 00:10:10.640
Shush!

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:14.740
It makes mine look conservative.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:19.580
With how small your lunch box is, how do you fit it all?

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:21.300
Are you a genius?

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:23.700
I look at cooking books and stuff.

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:26.970
It's not like I was perfect when I first started.

00:10:28.490 --> 00:10:30.830
You're really working hard, eh?

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:33.240
That's right. I am.

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:35.860
But you're getting better.

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:38.620
Didn't you say you were really bad at first?

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:39.800
Hey...

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:42.120
Remember the onigiri?

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:45.380
Stop smiling like that.

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:53.000
Should I make lunches for you?

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:55.880
No way! Really?

00:10:56.850 --> 00:11:00.370
I think I understand how Yuzuyu feels now.

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:03.570
Lunches make you happy!

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:06.880
Kokoro-chin, you'll make a great wife!

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:08.600
I might be able to.

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:09.970
You can! You can!

00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:14.650
If it was you and me, we'd have a wonderful child!

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:29.370
I... said something stupid again.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:32.100
Not really.

00:12:11.590 --> 00:12:12.390
Your phone...

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:12.880
Yeah...

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:20.130
Yes?

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:22.250
Yes.

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:28.410
Okay.

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:30.520
I can hear you.

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:32.460
Bye.

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:40.150
Who was that?

00:12:41.810 --> 00:12:42.850
Was it something bad?

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:44.600
Not really.

00:12:45.310 --> 00:12:45.930
But...

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:48.500
Let's eat lunch.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:16.810
Hey!

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:17.940
What is it!?

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:19.330
Some thing's  strange...

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:21.350
Some thing's strange about Kokoro-chin!

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:22.620
Strange?

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:25.640
After eating lunch, we couldn't talk.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.520
I wonder if she's feeling sick or something.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:31.520
Actually... What'd you make her eat, Kippei?

00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:33.890
It's not that!

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:34.850
It was a phone call...

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:36.120
A phone call?

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:40.130
After answering her phone, Kokoro-chan started acting weird.

00:13:40.780 --> 00:13:41.830
Who was it from?

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:43.420
She wouldn't tell me.

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:45.360
She said it was "nothing".

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:48.220
I wonder what it was...

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:49.610
I don't know.

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:51.050
I want to know.

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:54.570
If i can do anything to help, I want to...

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:18.010
We're gonna write a letter to someone important to us today!

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:22.070
It can be short, and you can draw pictures too!

00:14:22.350 --> 00:14:23.740
Okay!

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:27.380
Yuzuyu-chan!

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:30.330
Namiko-chan?

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:32.050
Let's do it together!

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:34.070
Sure.

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:38.780
Ah! A bear!

00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:39.720
Yep!

00:14:42.030 --> 00:14:46.060
Hey! You get along good with Marika-chan, right?

00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:47.050
Yep.

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:49.060
I see...

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:55.030
I... don't like her.

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:56.010
Huh?

00:15:02.390 --> 00:15:06.950
Because... she's stuck up, always get in the way, and ribbons and socks don't suit her well!

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:11.230
Namiko, you dumbshit!

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:25.630
Y-You're mean!

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:30.630
Marika-chan! What're you saying to your friend?

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:33.490
You mustn't use words like that!

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:38.360
I'm gonna do it by myself!

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:40.000
Marika-chan!

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:45.050
Namiko-chan?

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:50.140
Are you jealous of Marika-chan?

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:52.230
W-What!?

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:55.230
I'll go do it with Marika-chan!

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:07.980
Marika-chan!

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:19.340
What do you want?

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:23.110
Go do the rest with Namiko, who you get along with so well!

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:26.550
No!

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:29.330
I want to do it with you, Marika-chan!

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:43.230
I... wrote a letter to you, Yuzu.

00:16:45.550 --> 00:16:46.320
What?

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:51.360
What is it?

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:52.740
Yuzuyu?!

00:16:56.020 --> 00:16:57.180
But...

00:16:57.830 --> 00:17:00.850
I don't know why you're crying!

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:14.280
Wait a bit! I'll rewrite it for you, Marika-chan!

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:15.420
It's fine!

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:17.610
That'd be a pain!

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:24.600
Can I ask you something?

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:26.240
Sure.

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:29.930
Am I stuck up?

00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:30.960
Yes.

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:32.860
Do I show off?

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:33.560
Yes.

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:35.750
Do I get angry quickly?

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:36.370
Yes.

00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:38.440
And you don't mind?

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:39.270
No.

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:49.790
So we're friends, right?

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:51.880
Yep!

00:18:02.610 --> 00:18:03.710
Let's go back to the classroom.

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:04.880
Okay.

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:24.080
Kokoro-chan, are you okay?

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:25.610
Why do you ask?

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:32.280
Well... You seem kinda down... and you didn't finish all of your lunch...

00:18:32.980 --> 00:18:33.570
Sorry.

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:36.200
Even though you went to the trouble of making it for me, I...

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:38.690
That's not it!

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:42.330
I can always make you lunches. Everyday.

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:49.120
I want a mirror that'll show me your true feelings!

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:50.980
Sorry.

00:18:51.780 --> 00:18:52.740
Don't apologize.

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:56.710
Is there nothing I can do to help?

00:18:58.670 --> 00:19:01.290
You made me a lunch, right?

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:05.120
Go on now.

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:09.060
Yuzuyu-chan is waiting for you.

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:10.280
Okay.

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:13.480
Well, see you tomorrow.

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:47.770
Dad!

00:19:49.260 --> 00:19:50.020
Kokoro...

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:51.200
What is it?

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:52.410
Have you come back?

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:57.210
What're you doing?

00:19:58.180 --> 00:20:00.440
What're you trying to do?

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:06.350
It's because having roses around can hurt children...

00:20:09.530 --> 00:20:11.270
More importantly, you're coming in, right?

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:13.680
I want to have a long talk about that.

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:19.270
I just have some things I came to get.

00:20:26.230 --> 00:20:27.540
I'm home!

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:31.150
Kippei-onii-chan, hurry up!

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:34.930
I... have something I want to show you!

00:20:36.870 --> 00:20:38.580
Sorry Yuzuyu. I...

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:18.190
Kokoro-chin!

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:25.740
You know... I... already brought Yuzuyu home.

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:26.550
So...

00:21:28.020 --> 00:21:28.670
Sorry.

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:32.140
I don't want you to get any closer to me right now.

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:44.130
See you.

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:47.640
Kokoro-chan...

00:23:57.550 --> 00:23:58.500
Mr. Bear!

00:24:00.840 --> 00:24:04.440
I wonder if Kippei-onii-chan'll get back soon.

00:24:19.230 --> 00:24:20.280
Why? Why?

00:24:20.440 --> 00:24:22.300
Kokoro-chin isn't coming to school!

00:24:22.440 --> 00:24:23.340
I wonder what's wrong.

00:24:23.630 --> 00:24:24.630
It's bothering me!

00:24:24.850 --> 00:24:26.040
It bothers you, eh?

00:24:27.900 --> 00:24:31.140
Look! I wrote a letter to you, Kippei-onii-chan!

00:24:32.940 --> 00:24:34.030
I'm so happy!

00:24:34.300 --> 00:24:34.830
That's it!

00:24:35.000 --> 00:24:36.260
I'll write her a letter!

00:24:36.390 --> 00:24:37.420
Do your best!

00:24:37.590 --> 00:24:38.030
Okay!

00:24:38.900 --> 00:24:40.660
Next time on Aishiteru ze Baby:

00:24:41.020 --> 00:24:42.990
A Letter to someone you Love.

00:24:43.600 --> 00:24:46.800
If you get well, I'll teach you a charm!
